	"name": "Saltwater (Otanreh Bloodline)",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/water/wave-water-rolling-blue.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Living in the shallow reaches of oceans is a fair trade off for most species. You can’t grow quite as large as the monsters of the deepwater, but there’s plenty of life near to the shoreline to consume. For Saltwater adapted drek, this meant wading through the shallows, swimming with shark-like creatures offshore, and retreating to land to sleep.</p><h2>Fast Swimmer</h2><p>You gain a swim speed of 30ft, and you gain expertise on checks made to swim.</p><h2>Deep Breaths</h2><p>You can hold your breath for up to 30 minutes.</p><h2>Slippery when Wet</h2><p>Your people had to avoid being consumed by bigger beasts, granting you expertise on checks made to escape or maintain a grapple.</p>",
